# ==============================================================================
# Statistical Reproducibility Study: Zero-Trust Federated Learning for
# Healthcare Fraud Detection across HFL and VFL Configurations
# ==============================================================================
# Experimental Design:
#   Part 0: Centralized Baseline (Upper Bound)
#   Part 1: HFL Benchmark (10 Clients, Sample Partitioning)
#   Part 2: VFL Benchmark (10 Clients, Feature Partitioning)
#   Part 3: VFL Multi-Cloud Attack (3 Domain Clients)
#   Part 4: VFL vs HFL Direct Comparison
#
# Statistical Analysis: 5 random seeds, mean +/- std, 95% confidence intervals
# Metrics: Accuracy, Macro F1, ROC-AUC, PR-AUC, Per-class Precision/Recall
# ==============================================================================

